        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/973d4068474a2eb620e7c5da23f98801.poster.avif?t=1774014156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/973d4068474a2eb620e7c5da23f98801.webm?t=1774014156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/973d4068474a2eb620e7c5da23f98801.mp4?t=1774014156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOTDOG: THE VIDEOGAME - SURFING USA EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re out of a job, but not out of dreams. With your savings, you grab a hot dog cart and hit the beaches of the USA. Sell fast food, grow your business, and aim for the stars! Serve hot dogs with an insane, mind-blowing variety of toppings that drive customers wild, plus burgers, fries, ice pops, and sodas. Your aim is efficient greatness. Race against time, satisfy demanding customers who want their food now, and transform your cart into the ultimate fast-food joint. Ready to shine under the sun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/05c2d272b244665f66f29a2f267eb7c4.poster.avif?t=1774014156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/05c2d272b244665f66f29a2f267eb7c4.webm?t=1774014156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/05c2d272b244665f66f29a2f267eb7c4.mp4?t=1774014156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DREAMED ROADMAP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character's dream: the greatest fast-food restaurant ever. <strong>(✓)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 player co-op gameplay. <strong>(✓)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More ingredients. <strong>(✓)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee station. <strong>(✓)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, day/night cycle. Storms, rain, etc. <strong>(✓)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or with friends, it all starts with a hotdog. Join this adventure!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/973d4068474a2eb620e7c5da23f98801.poster.avif?t=1774014156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/973d4068474a2eb620e7c5da23f98801.webm?t=1774014156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/973d4068474a2eb620e7c5da23f98801.mp4?t=1774014156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOTDOG: THE VIDEOGAME - SURFING USA EDITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re out of a job, but not out of dreams. With your savings, you grab a hot dog cart and hit the beaches of the USA. Sell fast food, grow your business, and aim for the stars! Serve hot dogs with an insane, mind-blowing variety of toppings that drive customers wild, plus burgers, fries, ice pops, and sodas. Your aim is efficient greatness. Race against time, satisfy demanding customers who want their food now, and transform your cart into the ultimate fast-food joint. Ready to shine under the sun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/05c2d272b244665f66f29a2f267eb7c4.poster.avif?t=1774014156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/05c2d272b244665f66f29a2f267eb7c4.webm?t=1774014156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872110/extras/05c2d272b244665f66f29a2f267eb7c4.mp4?t=1774014156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DREAMED ROADMAP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character's dream: the greatest fast-food restaurant ever. <strong>(✓)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 player co-op gameplay. <strong>(✓)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More ingredients. <strong>(✓)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee station. <strong>(✓)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, day/night cycle. Storms, rain, etc. <strong>(✓)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or with friends, it all starts with a hotdog. Join this adventure!</p></li></ul>",
